{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "050S", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:1a562ccdaf6eb5ca2efd4917fd692434ed27683228ed8780b578abcf4b819a93", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nThis motivates the following definition.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:36265de68e91436dbe219e68dc67463b944d98d4bfc87e6b9e4ca9c387640a3f", "unit_id": "tag:050S:prose-0002"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "050S", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0002": "$f$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{Z}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{Z} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{Z} \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X}$", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-quasi-compact}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:8c3d7a79b7e9e504747b87059adc825d3fa52302e433411070036a87a685c708", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:a27eeea9413969e707852810d13fa9d9bc976511157ea52cacd7ef0f87996f52", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of algebraic stacks.\nWe say <MATH_0002> is <TEXTITOPEN_0001>quasi-compact<TEXTITCLOSE_0001> if for every quasi-compact\nalgebraic stack <MATH_0003> and morphism <MATH_0004>\nthe fibre product <MATH_0005>\nis quasi-compact.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:a89ffb562013aee8e2a8803fac86e147803749c05a66ae32ecaeffb8fcf38e98", "unit_id": "tag:050U:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "050S", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-characterize-representable-quasi-compact}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:b4b1395590cd2599891b63ff30cbf39d3b9ed525ea45aa5ef800d2143edf3681", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nBy\nLemma <REF_0001>\nabove this agrees with the already existing notion\nfor morphisms of algebraic stacks representable by algebraic spaces.\nIn particular this notion agrees with the notions already defined\nfor morphisms between algebraic stacks and schemes.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:afffe8569b02b97f403850005e3a603fc5c03702e5361864607f8ac8b87927af", "unit_id": "tag:050S:prose-0003"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "050S", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-base-change-quasi-compact}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:968b0a53fc39f77f001661628fd5a8a1e0261155a9d8db82057936d8bcae5b07", "source_text": "The base change of a quasi-compact morphism of algebraic stacks\nby any morphism of algebraic stacks is quasi-compact.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:77e3e27a7d746afb5fbf632a2766eb6afc068494b2e6e0ccfb25ec940f4c3365", "unit_id": "tag:050V:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "050S", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:fcb1623ed4a29758bf54a3cbd97c8081f35f10171a620c3c5ddd4e14f729d3d7", "source_text": "Omitted.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:872a8cfa74892c6e6464bd864d9f1c292f4f523caba3e51ac3dafbfc84db48f6", "unit_id": "tag:050V:proof"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "050S", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-composition-quasi-compact}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:db84e6a910917ff5d4dd9bfe747bb7de703167eb89857ba86e935f139813950b", "source_text": "The composition of a pair of quasi-compact morphisms of algebraic stacks\nis quasi-compact.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:f8cb7a10e6dbaef0fbf357f2e0dc4e262f67d4716e7eba2714525b7f656b5b45", "unit_id": "tag:050W:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "050S", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:fcb1623ed4a29758bf54a3cbd97c8081f35f10171a620c3c5ddd4e14f729d3d7", "source_text": "Omitted.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:872a8cfa74892c6e6464bd864d9f1c292f4f523caba3e51ac3dafbfc84db48f6", "unit_id": "tag:050W:proof"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "050S", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-closed-immersion-quasi-compact}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:55a8d2f7228489f506ad9b8ebca9fdbec81dce4351af533be35c40338b368844", "source_text": "A closed immersion of algebraic stacks is quasi-compact.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:d0a112eec8414e85ed07a643a2d9849c1f84bdd6709a8679c7e9e3e754cb5f26", "unit_id": "tag:0CL1:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "050S", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:fcb1623ed4a29758bf54a3cbd97c8081f35f10171a620c3c5ddd4e14f729d3d7", "source_text": "This follows from the fact that immersions are always representable and\nthe corresponding fact for closed immersion of algebraic spaces.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:bc933dcb1d7334ef736e63c926a4acfc0a0c9601fb404aeee95b7674f70b996b", "unit_id": "tag:0CL1:proof"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "050S", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\n\\mathcal{X} \\ar[rr]_f \\ar[rd]_p & &\n\\mathcal{Y} \\ar[dl]^q \\\\\n& \\mathcal{Z}\n}\n$$", "MATH_0002": "$2$", "MATH_0003": "$f$", "MATH_0004": "$p$", "MATH_0005": "$q$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-surjection-from-quasi-compact}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:9e349892ba070767351495369f7cb804bb18139e7a1ea5778b0f8ad68cd78e97", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:67c97d23dfabdc06620057a3fe9e5e099e0065aeae69d1f886885034b66a4b96", "source_text": "Let\n<MATH_0001>\nbe a <MATH_0002>-commutative diagram of morphisms of algebraic stacks.\nIf <MATH_0003> is surjective and <MATH_0004> is quasi-compact, then <MATH_0005> is quasi-compact.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:ab1bf0843be3e5c1e4785746392de03da739cbaa3a70b574497f987e75675df0", "unit_id": "tag:050X:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "050S", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{T}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{T} \\to \\mathcal{Z}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{T} \\times_\\mathcal{Z} \\mathcal{X} \\to\n\\mathcal{T} \\times_\\mathcal{Z} \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{T} \\times_\\mathcal{Z} \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{T} \\times_\\mathcal{Z} \\mathcal{Y}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{stacks-properties-lemma-base-change-surjective}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{stacks-properties-lemma-quasi-compact-stack}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:9ae1cbc95a36de4b96a6d1c0616c94e248d1e09b871858c554ee926c88ed98d6", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:9edf1ee276e52c6e11150087749782a64545ac53d94a476e670c50535cb4ca98", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a quasi-compact algebraic stack, and let\n<MATH_0002> be a morphism. By\nProperties of Stacks,\nLemma <REF_0001>\nthe morphism\n<MATH_0003>\nis surjective and by assumption\n<MATH_0004>\nis quasi-compact. Hence\n<MATH_0005>\nis quasi-compact by\nProperties of Stacks, Lemma <REF_0002>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:080bb07fce4ef2c690ded04da97ea150376eb87f51e5808215166d9d3137b6c9", "unit_id": "tag:050X:proof"}
